      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 12 ('Deep Mines (the live dungeon: robgoblins and rock crawlers round the mine's loop'): scene sh_deep_mines, 7 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Tuga the Bruiser last; every spot is the fork's."
